2026-07-27T08:07:09.2084980Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2149240Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2149919Z i /tmp/RtmpTUY2eN/duckdb
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2150281Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2150707Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2151376Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2151981Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2152866Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2153529Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2400128Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2508570Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:07:09.2960979Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T08:07:09.3127052Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
